{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49618","headline":"渔歌子 二 · 李珣","name":"渔歌子 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"荻花秋，潇湘夜，橘洲佳景如屏画。\n碧烟中，明月下，小艇垂纶初罢。\n水爲乡，蓬作舍，鱼羹稻饭常飡也。\n酒盈杯，书满架，名利不将心挂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李珣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49618.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49618","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}